       CCIIRRCCLLEEQQ__FFOORREEAACCHH()  and  CCIIRRCCLLEEQQ__FFOORREEAACCHH__RREEVVEERRSSEE() don’t allow _v_a_r to be
       removed or freed within the loop, as it would interfere with  the  tra‐
       versal.    CCIIRRCCLLEEQQ__FFOORREEAACCHH__SSAAFFEE()  and  CCIIRRCCLLEEQQ__FFOORREEAACCHH__RREEVVEERRSSEE__SSAAFFEE(),
